beh('B-election','A2','Main Raft loop, with per-peer vote RPC workers','Latest voter configuration, one campaign channel per candidate attempt','Follower timeout or TimeoutNow; optional pre-vote before election',['s-follower','s-candidate','s-election','s-vote'],implementation_guards=['Only a local voter campaigns; remote requests reject ineligible known candidates, stale terms and less up-to-date logs. Known leader suppresses ordinary vote requests; leadership transfer bypasses that suppression.','Each attempt asks each configured voter once and owns a fresh buffered response channel. Real election persists term and self vote before counting self. Majority of latest voters wins.'],writes=['Persisted currentTerm; lastVoteTerm and lastVoteCand; role and known leader'],durable_effects=['Term is persisted before its in-memory update. Vote writes term and candidate separately before returning granted.'],async_boundaries=['Old campaign replies go to the abandoned attempt channel; request workers can finish after an election attempt ends.'],important_branches=['Higher response terms step down; election timeout retries; pre-vote does not persist a new term. Vote storage error denies that vote.'],cross_activity_effects={'A1':'Election freshness and persistent vote checks constrain which log may drive subsequent formation.'},unknowns=['Crash/error atomicity across separate vote-key writes has not been investigated.'])
